E2E speedup = {{ versions["cuda_multi_pass"].e2e_speedup }}
```

In the current benchmark, the multi-pass version also does not clearly outperform the two-pass or grid-stride versions.

{% if "cuda_grid_stride_two_pass" in versions %}
For comparison:

```text
two-pass post-H2D time   = {{ versions["cuda_grid_stride_two_pass"].post_h2d_time_ms }} ms
